      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macon%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1895, The New York Times dubbed Macon \"The Central City\" for its booming railroad and textile industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
