      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macon%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Allman Brothers Band Museum, once the \"Big House\" where the band rehearsed in the 1970s, now preserves their history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
