      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macon%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ocmulgee Mounds National Historical Park, near downtown, preserves ancient Creek earthworks sacred to the Muscogee nation.",
